      "translation" : "好呀~！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Take care and",
      "translation" : "保重，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "enjoy your travels!",
      "translation" : "旅途愉快！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]",
      "translation" : "[拉莉塔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When you go East from this",
      "translation" : "從這個村子往東走，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "village, you will arrive at the ruins of an old shrine. It is now",
      "translation" : "就會到達一座古老神殿的遺蹟。那裡如今"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "a nest full of fearsome monsters.",
      "translation" : "成了可怕魔物的巢穴。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]",
      "translation" : "[拉莉塔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you plan to venture through these ruins, you better prepare",
      "translation" : "如果你打算穿越那些遺蹟，最好"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "as much as you can!",
      "translation" : "儘可能做好準備！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Lalitha]",
      "translation" : "[拉莉塔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Girl",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah...",
      "translation" : "啊..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
